---
import {properties} from '../data/properties';
---
<form id="enquiry-form" class="enquiry-form"><div class="form-intro"><h2>你的入住计划</h2><p>填写后生成咨询内容，复制并通过微信发送。</p></div><div class="form-grid"><div><label for="name">姓名</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" required/></div><div><label for="email">邮箱</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="150" required/></div><div><label for="phone">电话 <span>可选</span></label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40"/></div><div><label for="property">心仪住宿</label><select id="property" name="property"><option value="">想先了解一下</option>{properties.map(p=><option value={p.id}>{p.chineseName} · {p.name}</option>)}</select></div><div><label for="checkin">入住日期</label><input id="checkin" name="checkin" type="date" required/></div><div><label for="checkout">离开日期 <span>可选</span></label><input id="checkout" name="checkout" type="date"/></div><div><label for="guests">入住人数</label><input id="guests" name="guests" type="number" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></div><div class="form-spacer"></div><div class="form-full"><label for="message">想告诉我们的话 <span>可选</span></label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="例如租期、入住需求，或想了解的房源细节"></textarea></div></div><p id="form-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="form-submit"><button class="button" type="submit">生成入住咨询</button><small>表单内容仅在本地生成，不会自动提交。</small></div><div id="enquiry-result" class="enquiry-result" hidden><h3>请复制后，通过微信发送</h3><textarea id="enquiry-text" readonly rows="9" aria-label="生成的咨询内容"></textarea><div><button type="button" class="button" id="copy-enquiry">复制咨询内容</button><button type="button" class="text-link" data-wechat>查看微信二维码</button></div><p>发送给房东后，再确认房源、费用与具体入住安排。</p></div></form>
